  "notes": "{勘繰|かんぐ}る is a godan verb with a negative connotation — it implies suspicion that is often excessive or unfounded.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pattern: Xを{勘繰|かんぐ}る / 〜と{勘繰|かんぐ}る\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {裏|うら}を{勘繰|かんぐ}る (to suspect hidden motives)\n- 〜のではないかと{勘繰|かんぐ}る (to suspect that...)\n- {勘繰|かんぐ}りすぎ (being overly suspicious)\n\nThe noun form {勘繰|かんぐ}り means \"suspicion\" or \"being suspicious.\"",
